<%- include('./partials/header.ejs'); %>
<main class="page page-doc" id="page">
    <section class="hero hero-small">
        <h1>Questions</h1>
        <p class="lead">How <%= siteName %> works, and what happens to your files.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="faq">
        <details open>
            <summary>What is <%= siteName %>?</summary>
            <p>A simple, free file host: drop a file, get a link, share it. Files are deleted automatically after <%= expireTime %> <%= expireTimeUnit %>. Photos, documents, music, videos &mdash; up to <%= max_upload_size %> MiB each.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>What files are allowed?</summary>
            <p>Any kind of file, as long as it is legal in <%= ServerCountryLocation %> and you have the right to publish it.</p>
            <p>Malware is not allowed: anything that could be used to infect other computers may be removed at our discretion.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Do you keep logs?</summary>
            <% if (LOG_IP) { %>
                <p>While a file is online we keep its name, hash, upload time and the uploader's IP address. All of it is deleted when the file expires.</p>
            <% } else { %>
                <p>While a file is online we keep its name, hash and upload time &mdash; no IP addresses. All of it is deleted when the file expires.</p>
            <% } %>
            <p>Downloads and visits are not tracked or logged.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Can you remove my copyrighted file?</summary>
            <p>Send your takedown notice to <a href="mailto:<%= abuseContact %>"><%= abuseContact %></a>. We handle notices within <%= responseTime %> and disable access to the file once we receive a notice compliant with the Copyright Act.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Can you remove files that defame me or infringe other rights?</summary>
            <p>We act on takedowns for other files when they come with a certified <%= ServerCountryLocation %> court order; a preliminary injunction is usually also sufficient. Forward it to <a href="mailto:<%= abuseContact %>"><%= abuseContact %></a>.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Can you remove illegal files?</summary>
            <p>Please report illegal files to the appropriate law enforcement agency: we are not qualified to investigate crimes. Law enforcement officials can contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= abuseContact %>"><%= abuseContact %></a>; if you are from another country, we may cooperate voluntarily when the offence would also be illegal in <%= ServerCountryLocation %>.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>I have another question</summary>
            <p>Write to <a href="mailto:<%= infoContact %>"><%= infoContact %></a>.</p>
        </details>
    </section>
<%- include('./partials/footer.ejs'); %>
